  { role: "L1 technical support", risk: "High to medium", why: "Fixes by script go to AI. Diagnosis across several systems stays human for longer." },
  { role: "Back-office data processing", risk: "High", why: "Moving data between systems and standard reports is what automation does well." },
  { role: "Quality analyst (call review)", risk: "Medium to high", why: "Reuters reports a customer-service worker laid off as her employer adopted AI to review sales-call quality. Review is also being automated." },
  { role: "Complex and emotional cases, escalations", risk: "Lower", why: "Bots struggle with ambiguity and anger. A 2024 EY survey, quoted by Reuters, found 78% of Indian consumers prefer platforms that offer human support." },
